OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLight spells
OL,6,Fof rain will arrive during the
OL,7,Fevening, spreading northwards to reach
OL,8,Fmost areas as the night progresses.
OL,9,FCalm winds but feeling damp and chilly.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FAlthough it will be cloudy
OL,12,Fwith some light rain lingering during
OL,13,Fthe morning, a drier afternoon is
OL,14,Fexpected with the odd bright spell
OL,15,Fparticularly in the south.
