OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells throughout Sunday but still
OL,7,Frather chilly. Frost and fog for some
OL,8,Fon Monday morning, then a sunny autumn
OL,9,Fday. Sunny for most of Tuesday, with
OL,10,Frain arriving later.
